WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
But as a prior to joining FounderNexus,

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.040
I had this idea in my mind

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.680
that you have to go raise money first

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.120
and then you go build your product.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.440
And that's not the way it should be.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.240
Through the conversations I had with Court

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.920
and the other members of FounderNexus,

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.440
it became really clear to me that my priorities

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.880
as a founder needed to be in finding product market fit.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:17.720
First.
